{"title":"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Sabrina makes necklaces using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> purple beads and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> black beads on each necklace. After making <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> necklaces, how many beads has she used in total?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since she uses <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> purple beads and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> black beads on each necklace, each necklace has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/e/e8e87523e5da9ba074a78f8356e234da443043be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + 7 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /> beads.\n</p><p>Because she has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> necklaces, this means that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/4/7a40769eac28468de890bcbdfb39e5e6da746d5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"14\" /> beads in total.\n</p><p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_1\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 1\">player 1</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/1/1d198c9c5956d17907f8136cc45fd6e45dcfa5da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, the number of beads is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/4/5545c0e3d9758bf544ff6d9a6d619006aafa4673.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12N = 12 \\times 6 = \\boxed{72}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"164\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC\">2023 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_1\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 1\">Practice Relay Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_3\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 3\">Practice Relay Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=ed